do CutsceneManager.fade_from_black()
Fenn: Hello? Winston?
Az: Hmph. Everything [i]looks[/i] okay.
do! CutsceneManager.npc_move("Az", 000.0, 800, true, false)
do! CutsceneManager.player_move(700.0, 800, true, false)
do CameraManager.create_camera(Vector2(600.0, 700.0), 1.5, 5.7, "LINEAR", "EASE_IN_OUT")
Az: Wait, the pict-[wait=0.3] oh. Huh.
Winston grit: [font_size=100]WELCOME, [shake level=15 rate=50]FOOLS[/shake][/font_size]
do CutsceneManager.npc_face("Winston", "left")
do CameraManager.create_camera(Vector2(2500.0, 400.0), 2.0, 2, "CUBIC", "EASE_IN_OUT")
Az: [i]Whoa.[/i] Nevermind.
Az: Wait- [font_size=60][i]THAT'S[/i][/font_size] what you look like?
Winston grit: [font_size=80][shake level=7 rate=30][i]WHAT?![/i][/shake][wait=0.3] WHAT DO THEE MEANETH??[/font_size] 
Az laugh: You're just, like,[wait=0.3] a skinny nerd.
Winston awkward: [font_size=30]Ahem.[/font_size] 
Winston: [font_size=100][shake level=7 rate=30][i]BEHOLDETH![/i][/shake][/font_size]
Fenn starry: [font_size=100][wave freq=10 amp=30]BY THE SENDER![wait=0.3] IT'S-[/wave][/font_size]
Fenn worry: [font_size=70] It-[/font_size][wait=0.3][font_size=50] What-[/font_size][wait=0.3][font_size=40] what is it?[/font_size]
Winston grit: [font_size=70]MY LATEST CREATION.[/font_size]
Winston grit: [font_size=100][wave freq=10 amp=30]THE [color="521FA6"]ICI-CLONE[/color]!![/wave][/font_size]
Winston: Thou see, my power is limited. I may [i]maketh[/i] things. 
Winston: Tools. Devices. [wave freq=7 amp=20]Creatures[/wave].
Winston grit: But I cannot [i]controleth[/i] them.
Winston: [font_size=70]SO![/font_size][wait=0.3] I thought to myself... [i]what CAN I controleth?[/i]
Az: [font_size=35]Your incompetence?[/font_size]
Fenn starry: [font_size=60][wave freq=7 amp=30]Your attitude??[/wave][/font_size]
Winston grit: [font_size=100][shake level=7 rate=30]I CAN CONTROLETH MYSELF![/shake][/font_size]
Az: [font_size=40]Huh.[/font_size]
Fenn worry: Uh oh.
Winston grit: Why,[wait=0.3] if I maketh a copyeth of [wave freq=7 amp=20]myself[/wave]...
Winston: Wouldst it not want the same things I want? 
Winston grit: [wave freq=7 amp=20][i]Wouldst it not do the same things I wouldst?[/i][/wave]
Fenn: [font_size=60][i]Bring it on!! [/i][wave freq=7 amp=30][wait=0.3]I shalt free the Knights from thy grasp!!![/wave][/font_size]
Az: Wait, Fenn, hold on. 
Winston: [font_size=80]THUS! WITNESS THE CREATION!![/font_size]
Winston grit: [font_size=80] OF THE ONE. THE ONLY.[/font_size]
Winston: [font_size=100][shake level=10 rate=30][i][color="521FA6"]ICETON[/color]!![/i][/shake][/font_size]
do CutsceneManager.fade_to_black()
#do CutsceneManager.create_npc("Iceton", Vector2(3072,1024))
do CutsceneManager.npc_face("Iceton", "left")
