do CutsceneManager.wait(2)
#do CutsceneManager.play_sound("SmokeBellowing")
#do CutsceneManager.play_sound("MachineWhirring")
do CutsceneManager.fade_from_black()
Winston: [font_size=40]Holy sh- [wait=0.3]it [i]worked[/i]? [/font_size]
Winston grit: [font_size=60]IT WORKED!![/font_size]
Fenn worry: Are we in danger?
Az: Hmph. Maybe.
Winston grit: [font_size=80]ICETON, GO! [wait=0.3] [shake level=7 rate=30]DESTROYETH THEM![/shake][/font_size]
do! CutsceneManager.npc_move("Iceton", 2572.0, 250, true, false)
do! CutsceneManager.npc_move("Az", -500.0, 250, true, true)
do CutsceneManager.player_move(200.0, 250, true, true)
do CutsceneManager.wait(1)
Fenn worry: Uh oh.
do CutsceneManager.npc_face("Iceton","right")
do CutsceneManager.wait(1.5)
Az: Huh?
#do CutsceneManager.npc_move("Iceton", 4224, 2000, true, false)
Iceton turns around, rushes towards Winston, and starts beating him up.
Fenn worry: Winston?
Winston grit: NO! [font_size=40]No no... [/font_size][font_size=60][i][shake level=7 rate=30]STOP THIS![/shake][/i][/font_size]
Winston grit: Y- you're my creation! [wait=0.3][font_size=60]You're ME![wait=0.3] [shake level=7 rate=30][i]Listen to me!![/i][/shake][/font_size]
Winston awkward: Wh- why are you attacking me?[wait=0.3][font_size=40] P- please, [i]stop![/i][/font_size]
Az: Dang. Really thought... ah, nevermind.
Fenn worry: [i]Az![/i] We have to help him!
Az: [i]Ugh...[/i]
do EventBus.interrupt_dialogue.emit("0.4")
Fenn: He's in danger! He needs h-
Az annoy: [font_size=60][i]I know![/i][/font_size] I'll get him.
Fenn: What can I do?
Az: Remember that other heater?[wait=0.3] Past my [color="0B4F4A"]Workshop[/color]?
Fenn: Yeah?
Az: I can protect Winston in the meantime. It might just be enough to melt [color="521FA6"]Iceton[/color].
Az: The door at the back should lead you to it.
Fenn: On it!
do! MusicManager._fade_in()
do EventFlags.set_flag("13-AzWs-FinalConfrontation-Workshop", true)
